{"time": "20261117T171735Z", "think": "Final notes.", "command": "answer Notes: I work for the Toh-Reel-Ka (officer Never-Writes-Twice, Helstrom), rank Reel-Ka. Hist trees are sickening; the Unbound (Cuts-the-Old-Knot) drain sap. I need three seal-stones for the gate at Teku-Sul Spire off Lilmoth, to reach the Eye of Argonia at the Root. I now HAVE the Blackrose stone (Seal-Stone of the Kings): paid Corvus 300 gold toll, then bought the vault key from Okaz-Teel for 1000. I have about 350 gold left, plus Lockpicks, paralysis poison x3, Rapier, Reelka armour, Keystone, Sap-Jar and other items. STILL NEEDED: stone in the flooded vaults of Gemin (walk from Jal-Veesa, rootworm) and in the deepest hall of Vorannuhl (near Noota Nara, by boat); both marked. The Collector Ennodius Vanin is at Blackrose, outbid. Open questions: what moans in Fort Chalkmoth cellar (key not in the fort), how Nesh-Deeka knows the Unbound, and why Cuts-the-Old-Knot seals trees she drains.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Warden's Vault", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn14.vault-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1}, "gold": 650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "